---
---

<section id="skills" class="py-20 border-b border-zinc-800">
  <div class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-100 mb-4">Stack Tecnologico & Competenze</h2>
    <p class="text-zinc-400">Le tecnologie e gli standard operativi di riferimento.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col border-t border-zinc-800">
    
    <!-- Row 1 -->
    <div class="py-6 border-b border-zinc-800 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 items-start md:items-center hover:bg-zinc-800/30 transition-colors duration-150">
      <div class="md:col-span-4">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-200">Database & Data Engineering</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 mt-1">Progettazione schemi e integrità relazionale.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-8 flex flex-wrap md:justify-end gap-2">
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400">[SQL]</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400">[MySQL]</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400">[PostgreSQL]</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400">[E-R Modeling]</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Row 2 -->
    <div class="py-6 border-b border-zinc-800 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 items-start md:items-center hover:bg-zinc-800/30 transition-colors duration-150">
      <div class="md:col-span-4">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-200">Software Engineering</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 mt-1">Sviluppo backend e pattern architetturali.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-8 flex flex-wrap md:justify-end gap-2">
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400">[Java]</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400">[Kotlin]</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400">[Python]</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400">[C]</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400">[MVC]</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Row 3 -->
    <div class="py-6 border-b border-zinc-800 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 items-start md:items-center hover:bg-zinc-800/30 transition-colors duration-150">
      <div class="md:col-span-4">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-200">Metodologie IT</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 mt-1">Ingegneria del software e processi agili.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-8 flex flex-wrap md:justify-end gap-2">
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400">[UML]</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400">[SDLC]</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400">[Agile/Scrum]</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400">[System Design]</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Row 4 -->
    <div class="py-6 border-b border-zinc-800 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 items-start md:items-center hover:bg-zinc-800/30 transition-colors duration-150">
      <div class="md:col-span-4">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-200">Strumenti & Ambienti</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 mt-1">Infrastruttura, versionamento e automazione.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-8 flex flex-wrap md:justify-end gap-2">
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400">[Git]</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400">[Linux/Bash]</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400">[Wireshark]</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400">[Generative AI]</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
